        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Locker, Peter Timms, John Rando\n- Awards: Tony Awards, Drama Desk Awards\n- Works: A Christmas Story: The Musical, \"The Gift of the Magi\"\n- Roles: Director, actor, character\n\nFacts:\n- Jeff Locker starred as Peter Timms in a play.\n- John Rando directed the play starring Jeff Locker as Peter Timms.\n- John Rando was nominated for the 2014 Tony Award for Best Direction of a Musical.\n- The musical John Rando was nominated for directing was A Christmas Story: The Musical.\n- A Christmas Story: The Musical was based on the short story \"The Gift of the Magi.\"\n- \"The Gift of the Magi\" won the Drama Desk Award.",
